@ Ichor: Professor Daphne's new-game speech (design/phase1/SCRIPT.md, beat 0).
@ The labels keep Birch's names so src/main_menu.c needs no logic changes.

gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Ah, there you are. Sit, sit.\n"
	.string "The grass is dry today.\p"
	.string "Welcome to Aethos. Land of heroes,\n"
	.string "of olive groves, and of Pokémon.\p"
	.string "I'm Daphne. People call me a\n"
	.string "professor. I prefer “curious.”\p"
	.string "$"

@ The Smoliv comes out of its ball during the pause.
gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is a Pokémon.{PAUSE 96}\n"
	.string "Say hello, Smoliv.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Aethos is full of creatures like\n"
	.string "this one.\p"
	.string "We farm with them. We fish with\n"
	.string "them. Some of us fight beside them.\p"
	.string "And we tell stories about them.\n"
	.string "We always have.\p"
	.string "A serpent so huge a god had to\n"
	.string "slay it. A giant breathing fire.\p"
	.string "A trident that could split the sea\n"
	.string "in two.\p"
	.string "I think every myth is a memory of\n"
	.string "a Pokémon.\p"
	.string "Someone saw one, once, and simply\n"
	.string "couldn't stop talking about it.\p"
	.string "I study those memories. It's mostly\n"
	.string "walking. Some digging.\p"
	.string "And a great deal of being wrong,\n"
	.string "which is the best part.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "Now. Who's this standing in\n"
	.string "my grove?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Which of these two is you?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "And what do they call you?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}. Have I got that right?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER} of Elaia! Melitta's child.\n"
	.string "I should have guessed.\p"
	.string "You have her chin. The stubborn one.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Today is the Klotheia, when\n"
	.string "Kalliste's youths come of age.\p"
	.string "Your thread gets read. You get a\n"
	.string "partner. Then the road opens up.\p"
	.string "Come find me at the Akademia.\n"
	.string "I'd like you to meet someone.\p"
	.string "Three someones, actually.\p"
	.string "$"
